    "standardized_narrative": "The syndicate reported a net release of $25.1 million in prior year reserves in 2018. This release was primarily driven by the syndicate's consistent reserving philosophy, which involves setting initial reserves with risk margins that are released over time as uncertainty reduces. While the overall movement was a release, the Property line of business experienced a strengthening of $10.6 million due to rising costs from previous year's catastrophes, notably Hurricane Irma, and higher attritional losses. The 2017 underwriting year was also noted to forecast a breakeven position due to adverse claims experience from 2017 natural catastrophe events. Other lines of business, including Marine, Political, Accident & Contingency, Reinsurance, and Specialty lines, contributed to the overall release.",
